! Hand-crafted USITT ASCII 3.0 sample: standard keywords (CHAN ch/level, decimal and FL levels,
! FOLLOWON, LINK, PART), no PATCH (default 1:1), and the $SEQUENCE / $CUE / $$TEXT extensions
! written by ETC Congo and OLC.
IDENT 3:0
MANUFACTURER TEST
CONSOLE Handmade

CLEAR ALL

CUE 1
TEXT Pre-set
$$TEXT Préparation
UP 5
DOWN 5
CHAN 1/FL 2/50 3/H7F

CUE 2
TEXT Scene 1
UP 2.5 1
DOWN 4
FOLLOWON 3
CHAN 1/0 2/100 4/25
PART 1
UP 8
CHAN 5/FL

CUE 3
TEXT Back to one
UP 1
DOWN 1
LINK 1
CHAN 1/100

$SEQUENCE 2 0 Chaser
$CUE 2 10
TEXT Step A
UP 0.5
CHAN 10/FL
$CUE 2 11
TEXT Step B
UP 0.5
CHAN 11/FL

GROUP 7
TEXT Specials
CHAN 4/FL 5/FL
ENDDATA
